V13.9 CLEAN

- Restored the real Premium / Starter Variations switch in the Individual Trees header.
- New products keep Variations OFF by default; Premium / Starter can enable it, VIP / Random remain non-Child rooms.
- Expanded target-net-margin long-press override to VIP / Premium / Starter / Random on a per-product, per-room basis.
- Room-specific margin overrides never write back to the global Settings margin and are cleared when the product is removed from that room.
- Migrates the previous Random-only override into the new per-room override structure.
- Updated all visible/runtime version markers, manifest, version.json and service-worker cache to V13.9 / build 13900.
